      "en": "Hear therefore the LORD’s word, all you captives whom I have sent away from Jerusalem to Babylon.",
      "ko": "그런즉 내가 예루살렘에서 바벨론으로 보낸 너희 모든 포로여 나 여호와의 말을 들을찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "89d555aef5e20e92d65f5ea4f94d41d0c8bdd907fbaf50d01c9bbac823f431c9",
      "translation_text_hash": "ee32ececab28c6b2bd89afc35ecddf5a3e91b1b7b20f238e24b24560d1c067d7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
