      "en": "Zephaniah the priest read this letter in the hearing of Jeremiah the prophet.",
      "ko": "제사장 스바냐가 스마야의 글을 선지자 예레미야에게 읽어 들릴 때에",
      "source_text_hash": "98ef74b6810bcdb28b6f9c60a3d7868367e3aa7a9f7e2a1b18b643651bfc9783",
      "translation_text_hash": "b51ee9e81057cb89f353a0a761babdc96308689064ce4bf19fd135d674e51a1a",
